abstract: >-
  TanenBase is an Apache-2.0 open-source LoRaWAN (EU868) beehive scale and
  colony monitoring node built on the Seeed Studio XIAO nRF54LM20A, Wio-SX1262,
  and NAU7802 24-bit ADC. It features a 4.5 µA System OFF sleep current via a
  single-pass cold-boot state machine, runtime two-parameter load-cell thermal
  drift compensation (reducing diurnal thermal swing by 6.5x on a 22 kg load),
  Web Bluetooth provisioning, Extended Mode wireless in-hive BLE sensor scanning,
  and unified TTN v3 payload decoding for BEEP.nl and beelogger.de.
